<Defs>
	<!--
		Custom name pool for cheeches. On generation, each cheech rolls its first name and last name independently against this pool
		(60% each by default; see FirstNameFromCheechPoolChance / LastNameFromCheechPoolChance in HarmonyPatch_PawnGenerator_GeneratePawn),
		so a pawn can end up custom-first + vanilla-last, the reverse, both, or neither.

		- firstNames        : unisex, always eligible.
		- firstNamesMale    : added on top of firstNames for male pawns only (optional).
		- firstNamesFemale  : added on top of firstNames for female pawns only (optional).
		- lastNames         : surnames, used for every gender.

		First names may carry an optional everyday nickname (the cat's 'government name' they keep on file at the vet vs. the name
		everyone actually uses), written "Formal Name|Nickname". When such a name is rolled, the nickname becomes the pawn's displayed
		nick. Plain entries with no "|" have no nickname and fall back to vanilla nick behavior. Surnames never carry nicknames.

		You can add more <NameSetDef_Cheech> defs (here or in other files) and they all get merged.
	-->
